{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02974","headline":"登古阳云台 · 张九龄","name":"登古阳云台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭树日衰飒，风霜未云已。\n驾言遣忧思，乘兴求相似。\n楚国兹故都，兰台有余址。\n传闻襄王世，仍立巫山祀。\n方此全盛时，岂无婵娟子。\n色荒神女至，魂荡宫观啓。\n蔓草今如积，朝云爲谁起。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}